<title>USA: SBS Technologies names Amenson CEO.</title>
<headline>SBS Technologies names Amenson CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ALBUQUERQUE, N.M. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBS Technologies Inc said Monday it had named its president, Christopher Amenson, as chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Amenson succeeds Andrew Cruce, who remains chairman and an employee of the company, focusing on strategic planning and technology.</p>
<p>SBS Technologies is a leading manufacturer of standard bus embedded computer components.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
